{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theta is a little girl who turns left every time she hits a wall. She is curious about the sinking world and discovers a mysterious place, where she picked up a fork that can split her into multiple copies of herself, and from that moment, the world changes forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/cef654da6c37e3b391e022a5651b1615.poster.avif?t=1767260914\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/cef654da6c37e3b391e022a5651b1615.webm?t=1767260914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/cef654da6c37e3b391e022a5651b1615.mp4?t=1767260914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of splitting to solve puzzles! Split yourself, the universe and something even vaster...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/2267bc0dc474811dcb22f79966e46c0a.poster.avif?t=1767260914\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/2267bc0dc474811dcb22f79966e46c0a.webm?t=1767260914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/2267bc0dc474811dcb22f79966e46c0a.mp4?t=1767260914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ga